#4471 was filed as one known issue. The reports in it are separate problems.

The shared parser reads a day-first date month-first. On booking-v3 the form hint says `MM/DD/YYYY`, people type the month first, and the form reads the day first. Some reports are a one-day move. The table below is the desk's own view: it counts each report under the cause it filed, and footnotes the one-day move.

